          <div class="font-body text-base text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed space-y-5 max-w-[65ch]">
            <p>This is supportive Wellness Counselling under ASCHP registration, facilitated in a group setting. It is distinct from clinical psychology, psychotherapy, psychiatry and medical treatment, and it does not include diagnosis of psychiatric conditions or the management of medication.</p>
            <p>Where a participant needs specialist psychological, psychiatric, addiction, crisis or medical care, that is named directly and handled through the referral pathways agreed with your organisation before the programme starts. <a href="/scope/" class="cgo-inline-link">Read the full scope and ethics.</a></p>
